  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2802.03 Electronic means",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2802.03 “Electronic means” means the method of sending documents, including but not limited to reports and notifications, to the department by fax, as an email or an attachment to an email, or through an electronic reporting system designed and intended to be used for submitting documents electronically to the department.\n\nSource. #12693, eff 12-22-18",
